      "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:Comic Sans MS;font-size:14pt;color:#000000\">A total of </span><span style=\"font-family:Comic Sans MS;font-size:14pt;color:#000000\"><span class=\"field-token function-table-token\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-field-name=\"Counter\" title=\"Counter\" draggable=\"true\">&lt;&lt;Counter&gt;&gt;</span></span><span style=\"font-family:Comic Sans MS;font-size:14pt;color:#000000\"> emails have been sent out.</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Comic Sans MS;font-size:14pt;color:#8A0000\"><i>This is what your letter looked like:</i></span></p>"
